            "author": {
              "name": "Kimi.ai",
              "handle": "Kimi_Moonshot"
            },
            "text": "Introducing Kimi K3.1 Pro: our most capable 3T-class open-weight model.\n\n🔹 1M-token context, 2.8T total / 104B active params (MoE), Multimodal.\n🔹 Full-project coding: games in Unreal, Unity & Godot.\n🔹 Excels at parametric 3D modeling in Blender & CAD.\n🔹 More reliable at finance work: Accurate modeling with hallucination down by 65%.\n🔹 Matching the strongest proprietary models across coding, agentic and knowledge benchmarks.\n\nKimi K3.1 Pro and K3.1 Pro Highspeed (2–3× faster) are now live on Kimi.ai, Kimi Work, Kimi Code, and the Kimi API.  \n\nOpen weights by Nov 4, 2026.\n\n🔗 API: platform.kimi.ai \n🔗 Tech blog: kimi.ai/blog/kimi-k3-1…",
